      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I am so sorry you are feeling this unbearable weight that seems to have no end or escape. While the pain you describe is real and unbearable, I encourage you to listen to a crisis counselor or a 24/7 suicide prevention helpline to help you find relief.\nI am deeply glad you feel I care about you and I am committed to offering the support I can through these words.",
